From: Nikhil Gurram <nikhgurr@qti.qualcomm.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: apply MLDUnit changes using verified runtime links

Resolve links by MAC, band and interface type instead of trusting cached
primary interfaces or reused link IDs. Continue past AP/VLAN mirrors when
finding the running AP. Track unapplied numeric membership changes even
when the corresponding hostapd configuration fields compare equal.

Suppress startup broadcast deauthentication when ADD joins a live source
or destination MLD, then restore the original per-BSS policy after verifying
the added link. Bound restore retries without tearing down a working link.

Signed-off-by: Nikhil Gurram <nikhgurr@qti.qualcomm.com>

